{"type":"message","id":"f8f778a7","parentId":"460b120d","timestamp":"2026-05-04T05:16:35.222Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The researcher and writer agents couldn't generate a response via openclaw agent. Likely openclaw CLI not installed or not in PATH? Using exec may not have openclaw binary. We may need to call via `openclaw` which should be available. But earlier attempts still failed. Perhaps need to specify full path? The binary likely at ~/.npm-global/bin/openclaw but PATH may not include. Could use `~/.npm-global/bin/openclaw`. Let's check which openclaw exists.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8851b74ce43dfe68","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which openclaw || echo notfound","wait":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openai/gpt-oss-120b:free","usage":{"input":150,"output":135,"cacheRead":13648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13933,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777871788640,"responseId":"gen-1777871789-iNkO5W6nPOCkrGYYFkpv"}}
