{"type":"message","id":"481aeec5","parentId":"327db519","timestamp":"2026-05-04T05:19:33.512Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We have a problem: creator agent asks for details, but we already have them in variables. Possibly the creator agent needs a different prompt format, but we gave details. It still responded asking for info. Maybe the agent expects the variables inserted differently, maybe quoting needed. The SOUL says: \"Generate a feature image for this article. Title: 'ARTICLE_TITLE'. Topic: IMAGE_TOPIC. Key Facts: IMAGE_FACTS. Crypto Asset: IMAGE_ASSET. Use the Scene Formula...\" We followed that.\n\nBut the agent responded asking for details, meaning maybe the agent didn't receive the data due to variable expansion not happening? In the exec we used single quotes around $ARTICLE_TITLE etc; inside single quotes, shell doesn't expand. Indeed we used: Title: '$ARTICLE_TITLE'. That prevents expansion. Should use double quotes or no quotes.\n\nWe need to send a correct message with the variables expanded.\n\nLet's construct a command that expands variables correctly. Use double quotes around the message string, but need to escape inner double quotes.\n\nSimplify: build the full message string in shell variable then pass.\n\nWe'll do:\n\nMESSAGE=\"Generate a feature image for this article. Title: \\\"$ARTICLE_TITLE\\\". Topic: $IMAGE_TOPIC. Key Facts: $IMAGE_FACTS. Crypto Asset: $IMAGE_ASSET. Use the Scene Formula in your SOUL.md to pick the right human subject and scene, then run the API calls and logo stamp steps exactly as defined in your SOUL.md.\"\n\nThen pass to openclaw agent.\n\nLet's write a shell script to do that.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b09ee4e24e996476","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"source /tmp/pipeline_vars.sh && rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/creator/sessions/sessions.json && MESSAGE=\"Generate a feature image for this article. Title: \\\"$ARTICLE_TITLE\\\". Topic: $IMAGE_TOPIC. Key Facts: $IMAGE_FACTS. Crypto Asset: $IMAGE_ASSET. Use the Scene Formula in your SOUL.md to pick the right human subject and scene, then run the API calls and logo stamp steps exactly as defined in your SOUL.md.\" && openclaw agent --agent creator --message \"$MESSAGE\" --deliver > /tmp/creator-output.txt","wait":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openai/gpt-oss-120b:free","usage":{"input":180,"output":462,"cacheRead":15280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15922,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777871953441,"responseId":"gen-1777871954-U8YbZ7OarddRvW25ZEtk"}}
